// Summary: Default user settings for the VS Code that runs inside the
//          container. Copied into the home volume on first start; VS Code
//          reads settings.json as JSONC, so these comments are allowed.
// Notes: See README file for documentation and full license information.
//
// Copyright © 2026 Gabriel Mongefranco
//
